Others permitted to vote: The parties have agreed that the Maintenance Lead, Master Operation Technician, Production Lead, and Warehouse/Cooler Lead classifications may vote in the election, but their ballots will be challenged since their eligibility has not been resolved.  No decision has been made regarding whether these classifications are included in, or excluded from, the bargaining unit.  The Employer’s position is that these classifications are supervisory within the meaning of Section 2(11) of the Act.  The eligibility or inclusion of these classifications will be resolved, if necessary, following the election.

